k. Export to Blender with one press.", "short_description": "Real clay. Your room. Sculpt without limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://emotionull.art/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Emotionull", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://emotionull.art/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345650630966511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "888881050951536"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785211200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "888881050951536"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1428415126023394", "version": "0.2.310"}, "id": "1278478724173176", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1428415126023394"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "- Hand tracking, rebuilt: your real hands now show in front of the clay instead of vanishing into it. A relaxed pinch lays full-size clay, and tracking glitches no longer fling strokes across the room or freeze your cursor. Hands also use Meta's standard tracking rate again, which is steadier for close work and in dim rooms.\r\n- New Sculpt Panel for hand tracking: your main tools, Add / Remove (one tap to carve out eyes), brush size with S / M / L, strength, colours, Undo / Redo and Center (brings your sculpt back in front of you), all within reach. Tap its buttons with a fingertip or point and pinch; pinch its top bar to move it, and fold it to its bar with \"-\". It hides while you hold controllers, and you can turn it off in Preferences.\r\n- New hand gestures: pinch your other hand's middle finger and thumb to hold the sculpt and turn it; pinch your ring finger and thumb to open the tool ring.\r\n- With controllers, the thumbstick now shows your brush size at the tip while you change it, and resizes a little faster.\r\n- Paint's Stomp mode now says what it does: each pull fills the whole layer with your colour (the same as Fill layer).", "created_date": 1792615422, "id": "1428415126023394", "version": "0.2.310", "version_code": 310, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345650624299845", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1428415126023394"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1278478724173176"}]}, "change_log": "some visual fixes to ease flow of sculpting.", "created_date": 1792273394, "id": "1424817093049864", "version":